<title>USA: Touch Tone to buy Int'l Telecom.</title>
<headline>Touch Tone to buy Int'l Telecom.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Touch Tone America Inc said it signed a letter of intent to buy International Telecom Services Inc, a privately held long distance telephone services reseller based in Miami.</p>
<p>It said completion of the deal is subject to due diligence by both parties.</p>
<p>Terms of the planned purchase were not disclosed.</p>
